   "title": "Happy China National Day/ Dad Birthday/ Solo Day",
   "text": "Pretty cool so far! National day doesn’t have much public celebrations here in Chongqing which is a shame. Border security wasn’t too tough. I need to get an urgent lesson in Chinese tones as I’m clearly unintelligible 😭.\n\nShoutout to the chef who came out of the kitchen to teach me to eat noodles the Chinese way and his whole family for good vibes and conversation even if it was in Mandarin. Aymon arrives tomorrow which is when the party really starts🛬🎉\n\nHappy birthday to Dad as well as China! Who knew!",
