   "title": "We love Chongqing",
   "text": "Texting in from a gorgeous high speed train through countryside that looks like a fairytale (pics attached, phone aperture too slow). Last day in Chongqing was awesome, Buddhist temple in the middle of skyscrapers was the highlight. Took the metro for a while to see the outskirts but the city just keeps going, skyscraper flats for tens of kilometres! Took the metro through an apartment block to start a series of things An Bord Pleanála would never allow alongside today’s train station.",
